**Job Summary**

We are looking for a Full Stack Developer skilled in TypeScript, React, Node.js/Golang, SQL, cloud platforms, Terraform, and automated testing.

**Mandatory Skill-set**

* Degree or Diploma in Computer Science, Computer or Electronics Engineering, Information Technology or related field;
* Must have 5 years of full-stack development experience in TypeScript, React, Node.js and/or Golang;
* Strong SQL and relational database design skills;
* Hands-on experience with AWS/GCP/Azure and Terraform;
* Experience in unit, integration, and end-to-end automated testing;
* Strong troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills;
* Good working experience in microservices architecture;
* Good understanding on DevOps, Agile Methodology, modern application development;
* A strong yet independent team player who is proactive with a digital mindset;
* Good interpersonal skills with excellent verbal and written communication skills.

**Desired Skill-set**

* AI/LLM development, OLAP, and analytical databases;
* Kafka, event streaming, distributed and high-throughput transactional systems experience.

**Responsibilities**

* Design and build scalable, high-performance services;
* Lead system design, architecture, and documentation;
* Conduct code reviews and mentor team members;
* Collaborate with teams to deliver business requirements;
* Follow Agile practices and use AI tools for development;
* Monitor production services and resolve issues quickly.

Should you be interested in this career opportunity, please send in your updated resume to
**apply@sciente.com**
at the earliest.

When you apply, you voluntarily consent to the disclosure, collection and use of your personal data for employment/recruitment and related purposes in accordance with the SCIENTE Group Privacy Policy, a copy of which is published at SCIENTE’s website (https://www.sciente.com/privacy-policy).

Confidentiality is assured, and only shortlisted candidates will be notified for interviews.

